# pop'n music 9, Gambler Z (event phase 1), with --autoplay: the registered card of
# popn9-card-new.his (PIN 1234), NORMAL, three songs played by the game itself (every note GREAT,
# 100000 each), ALL STAGE CLEARED and the staff roll; then the labyrinth: "1階 Aフロア", three
# steps (one per cleared stage), the battery RAM's settings +0x1c going -1 -> -4 (0x121219c in
# RAM); then register_gz and GAME OVER. Red is pressed every 240 frames until the last results;
# during the songs autoplay ignores it. Set the phase with tools/unlock.py popn9 --nvram DIR
# phase=1 on the save popn9-card-new.his left. About 38,000 frames. (The watch columns in
# frames.txt show the EE's little-endian words byte-swapped: gzpos ffff0000 -> fcff0000.)
#   hiraku-popn9 --autoplay --nvram DIR --script oracle/scripts/popn9-gamblerz.his
game popn9
watch mode u32 0x25a0d8
watch gzflags u32 0x1212198
watch gzpos u32 0x121219c
watch gzfloor u8 0x12121a0
at 4500 press "Coin 1" 8
at 4540 press "Coin 1" 8
at 4700 press "P1 Button 5" 8
at 5050 press "Card" 8
at 5400 press "Keypad 1" 8
at 5430 press "Keypad 2" 8
